commit 7d98f6d8b668a59aa4494e897521a6d42e19429d
Date: 2026-09-20T23:26:32+02:00

fix: preserve stack traces for failed helper loads

The loader helpers exit without running ERR, and internal calls do not
replace the current DEBUG trace. Keep that trace instead of attributing a
missing helper to the preceding successful load. Also retain the helper
source frame when sourcing returns a nonzero status.

Cover both loader APIs with missing-helper and nonzero-return cases.

Fixes #1186.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex
Signed-off-by: Mingyang Wu <129849514+aprylewu@users.noreply.github.com>


